+  "Round 3's D4 fix: from element e back, the first element an indexed
+  operation appended, and that operation, as [e op]; nil at ::init. An element
+  no indexed operation appended (a failed one's: a dirty update) is not a
+  version anyone could have installed, so the version before it is."
